; FreeDOS configuration for the os8088 DOS floppy (SPEC.md 59.1).
; Tuned for an 8088: every line here is either buying back low memory or
; staying away from something that needs a 286.
;
; NEVER add DOS=HIGH or DEVICE=HIMEM.SYS/FDXMS.SYS. Both need a 286 or
; better - there is no HMA and no XMS on this machine, so everything DOS
; allocates is unconditionally low and the tuning below is the only lever.

FILES=10
BUFFERS=5
STACKS=0
LASTDRIVE=C
SWITCHES=/N
SHELL=B:\COMMAND.COM B:\ /P /E:512
